      "content": "wait what?? doubling my dose sounds kinda extreme and dangerous... and i've never heard of tryptophan causing issues. u sure about the l-tryptophan? i just want something that works without feeling like i'm being medicated by a scientist lol. is there any way to just mix the st johns wort with a smaller dose of the lexapro instead?",
